{"4552960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AAA Island Hotline", "steam_appid": 4552960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/bb44bfefa33e38d5b5bd572bc981dcca.avif?t=1781710179\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras_big/bb44bfefa33e38d5b5bd572bc981dcca.webp?t=1781710179 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ：1091963690</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rednote\\Bilibili：海岛热线接线员</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:Email：fancy_overflow@foxmail.com\">Email：fancy_overflow@foxmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AAA Island Hotline</strong> is a cozy desktop idle farm sim. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet little turtle has finally grown to the size of an entire island! Now, it’s time to settle down and enjoy a relaxing life on the waves with your giant companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your island, you can grow crops, raise adorable animals, stay in touch with friends via satellite phone, and order seeds or eggs through your TV. Most importantly, you can crossbreed your animals to discover endless new variations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/64499c7d11df03357d5eea160226e19f.poster.avif?t=1781710179\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/64499c7d11df03357d5eea160226e19f.webm?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/64499c7d11df03357d5eea160226e19f.mp4?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of adorable animals with countless color combinations!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like no two leaves in the world are exactly the same, <strong>no two cats on your island will ever be identical!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget traditional biology—breeding here is about more than just &quot;copy and paste.&quot; Through scientific selection (or just a bit of luck!), you can raise animals with colors that defy common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/aaec86d6c8d6377888a2e5de2758b269.poster.avif?t=1781710179\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/aaec86d6c8d6377888a2e5de2758b269.webm?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/aaec86d6c8d6377888a2e5de2758b269.mp4?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whether you’re working or studying, just tuck your island into a corner of your screen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no urgent tasks, and no goals you have to complete~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let these little creatures keep you company and cheer you on while you tackle your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/3afbbd932eabc1d7f3ddb8796b223994.poster.avif?t=1781710179\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/3afbbd932eabc1d7f3ddb8796b223994.webm?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/3afbbd932eabc1d7f3ddb8796b223994.mp4?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From lush plants to charming decorations, you have total control over your environment. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a blank canvas and build your own mini-world from the ground up. With tons of customization options, feel free to decorate your island into the dream paradise you’ve always imagined!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/2f5eda8072f4e4e95c7288168038027d.poster.avif?t=1781710179\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/2f5eda8072f4e4e95c7288168038027d.webm?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/2f5eda8072f4e4e95c7288168038027d.mp4?t=1781710179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras/bb44bfefa33e38d5b5bd572bc981dcca.avif?t=1781710179\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552960/extras_big/bb44bfefa33e38d5b5bd572bc981dcca.webp?t=1781710179 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ：1091963690</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rednote\\Bilibili：海岛热线接线员</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:Email：fancy_overflow@foxmail.com\">Email：fancy_overflow@foxmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AAA Island Hotline</strong> is a cozy desktop idle farm sim. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet little turtle has finally grow